nd restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vertex Digital Infrastructure</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#111111] text-zinc-400 antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen relative selection:bg-zinc-800 selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Container Lines with Mini Squares -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-50 flex justify-center w-full h-full mix-blend-screen overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full border-x border-zinc-800/40 relative\">\n            <!-- Mini corner squares -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 -left-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-600 bg-[#111]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -left-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-600 bg-[#111]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 -right-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-600 bg-[#111]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 -right-[3px] w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-600 bg-[#111]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Vertical Container Center Line -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-px h-full bg-zinc-800/30\"></div>\n            <!-- Intersections -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-600 bg-[#111]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[5px] h-[5px] border border-zinc-600 bg-[#111]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL/Canvas Animated Dither Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"digitalMap\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-screen flex flex-col items-center pt-10 px-8\">\n\n        <!-- Top Navigation Panel Wrapped in Border Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-4xl p-[1px] rounded-[1.6rem] bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700/60 via-zinc-900/20 to-zinc-900/10 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] relative group mb-10\">\n            <nav class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a]/40 rounded-[calc(1.6rem-1px)] p-6 flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap items-stretch relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-2xl gap-8 md:gap-0\">\n                <!-- Subtle glow overlay -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800/10 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Brand Column -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between min-w-[140px] md:pr-8 md:border-r border-zinc-800/50\">\n                    <div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sun-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-zinc-100 mb-4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <h1 class=\"text-base text-zinc-100 font-light tracking-tight\">Vertex</h1>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-12\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] animate-pulse\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">Available for partnerships</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Links Columns -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap md:flex-nowrap gap-8 md:gap-16 md:px-8 flex-1\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-zinc-100 text-sm mb-1 font-light tracking-tight\">Launch</h2>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-100 flex items-center gap-2 font-light\"><span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-zinc-400 rounded-full\"></span> Dashboard</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Process</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Connect</a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-zinc-600 text-sm mb-1 font-light tracking-tight\">Studio</h2>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">History</a>\n                        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors\">Team</a>\n